; profile: step=one
; A cycle through the second order of an independent pair: x becomes y and p
; becomes q, each on its own; y and q together give x back.  The step from
; (x q) to (y q) is the second order of the pair at (x p); a cycle is
; reported through it.
(x)
(p)
(rule a (take (x)) (make (y)))
(rule b (take (p)) (make (q)))
(rule c (take (y) (q)) (make (x) (q)))
